2405..2479 Comment "/// Spinning undoes winding at every loop (cubical\'s `decodeEncode` at the"
2480..2554 Comment "/// point): the round trip at a variable, by induction over the words. The"
2555..2633 Comment "/// result type reads the word the fold descends on, so each arm answers it at"
2634..2705 Comment "/// its letter and the recursive call at the rest: `sect[<](q)` relates"
2706..2781 Comment "/// `spin(wind(q))` to `q`, and carried along `loopOn` it relates `loop ∷"
2782..2862 Comment "/// spin(wind(q))`, which `spin(wind(loop ∷ q))` runs to, to `loop ∷ q`. The"
2863..2939 Comment "/// case respects the cancellations: at `loop ∷ back(loop) ∷ q` the arms"
2940..3016 Comment "/// compose to `cong(loopOn, cong(unloopOn, p))`, whose functions compose to"
3017..3089 Comment "/// the identity under the words\' rules, so the chain is `p` itself, the"
3090..3108 Comment "/// answer at `q`."
